    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noland Ridge:</strong> Once a gleaming metropolis, now shrouded in a toxic tomb, a testament to ambition's rampage and vengeance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Nomad</strong>, a victim of the chaos, driven by a city's desperate plea and a legacy whispered by your grandfather. Fragmented memories ignite your purpose, fueling your fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/01a740888f256d30dc0a36205391b030.poster.avif?t=1755010842\" width=760 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/01a740888f256d30dc0a36205391b030.webm?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/01a740888f256d30dc0a36205391b030.mp4?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unmasking the Conspiracy:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without getting seen, hack into energy towers to access restricted zones and unravel the tangled web of deceit shrouding Noland's demise. Decipher cryptic messages that weave a narrative of scientific arrogance, festering grudges, and a once-great city's tragic fall. Hear the city's final, gut-wrenching cries and the chilling pronouncements of a corrupt corporation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mastering the Urban Jungle:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your arsenal of parkour prowess honed through rooftop survival - <strong><u>scale walls, launch yourself with grappling hooks, dash with blazing speed, and defy gravity with gliding maneuvers to navigate the treacherous environment and decaying structures</u></strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie wisps weave through the deserted city streets. Are they fragments of forgotten memories, or phantoms searching for solace? Follow their spectral trail to sharpen your parkour skills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/6ea43ea97c423e3ad0a5b1a123460f4a.poster.avif?t=1755010842\" width=760 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/6ea43ea97c423e3ad0a5b1a123460f4a.webm?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/6ea43ea97c423e3ad0a5b1a123460f4a.mp4?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Captain's Descent:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm-tossed captain crashed his ship into Noland's maximum-security prison, carrying a mysterious crystal pulsing with power. Mistaken for an escapee, he unleashed the crystal's energy for his freedom. Consumed by frustration and spite, he transformed into a power-hungry maniac, seizing control of the prison, then the entire city. But his dominion came at a dreadful cost: he became dependent on the crystal for survival, shrouding the city in a toxic cloud breathable only by the mutated. <br>Mutated Mayhem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The misuse of the crystal's power has unleashed a horrific consequence. Mutated inmates now roam free, twisted monstrosities fueled by the captain\u2019s influence. They target anyone who tries to oppose his agenda. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hope in the Shadows:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Use the shadows to your advantage.</u></strong> Stalk your prey unseen and unleash devastating stealth takedowns to eliminate mutated threats. Every enemy neutralized weakens their hold on the city and levels the battlefield for your final confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/75624ca46014f4f2e4fa4f4085ed28b9.poster.avif?t=1755010842\" width=760 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/75624ca46014f4f2e4fa4f4085ed28b9.webm?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/75624ca46014f4f2e4fa4f4085ed28b9.mp4?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you honor your grandfather's legacy and become a beacon of hope? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Noland Ridge rests on your shoulders.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noland Ridge:</strong> Once a gleaming metropolis, now shrouded in a toxic tomb, a testament to ambition's rampage and vengeance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are Nomad</strong>, a victim of the chaos, driven by a city's desperate plea and a legacy whispered by your grandfather. Fragmented memories ignite your purpose, fueling your fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/01a740888f256d30dc0a36205391b030.poster.avif?t=1755010842\" width=760 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/01a740888f256d30dc0a36205391b030.webm?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/01a740888f256d30dc0a36205391b030.mp4?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unmasking the Conspiracy:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without getting seen, hack into energy towers to access restricted zones and unravel the tangled web of deceit shrouding Noland's demise. Decipher cryptic messages that weave a narrative of scientific arrogance, festering grudges, and a once-great city's tragic fall. Hear the city's final, gut-wrenching cries and the chilling pronouncements of a corrupt corporation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mastering the Urban Jungle:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize your arsenal of parkour prowess honed through rooftop survival - <strong><u>scale walls, launch yourself with grappling hooks, dash with blazing speed, and defy gravity with gliding maneuvers to navigate the treacherous environment and decaying structures</u></strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie wisps weave through the deserted city streets. Are they fragments of forgotten memories, or phantoms searching for solace? Follow their spectral trail to sharpen your parkour skills.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/6ea43ea97c423e3ad0a5b1a123460f4a.poster.avif?t=1755010842\" width=760 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/6ea43ea97c423e3ad0a5b1a123460f4a.webm?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/6ea43ea97c423e3ad0a5b1a123460f4a.mp4?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Captain's Descent:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A storm-tossed captain crashed his ship into Noland's maximum-security prison, carrying a mysterious crystal pulsing with power. Mistaken for an escapee, he unleashed the crystal's energy for his freedom. Consumed by frustration and spite, he transformed into a power-hungry maniac, seizing control of the prison, then the entire city. But his dominion came at a dreadful cost: he became dependent on the crystal for survival, shrouding the city in a toxic cloud breathable only by the mutated. <br>Mutated Mayhem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The misuse of the crystal's power has unleashed a horrific consequence. Mutated inmates now roam free, twisted monstrosities fueled by the captain\u2019s influence. They target anyone who tries to oppose his agenda. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hope in the Shadows:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Use the shadows to your advantage.</u></strong> Stalk your prey unseen and unleash devastating stealth takedowns to eliminate mutated threats. Every enemy neutralized weakens their hold on the city and levels the battlefield for your final confrontation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/75624ca46014f4f2e4fa4f4085ed28b9.poster.avif?t=1755010842\" width=760 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/75624ca46014f4f2e4fa4f4085ed28b9.webm?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067620/extras/75624ca46014f4f2e4fa4f4085ed28b9.mp4?t=1755010842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you honor your grandfather's legacy and become a beacon of hope? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of Noland Ridge rests on your shoulders.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore, fight and survive on the rooftops of Noland Ridge, a city turned into a science experiment. In this Open World, Stealth-Adventure game with a Retro look, you are free to explore the map however and whenever you want!",
